sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>EnquiriesPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewEnquiriesBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewEnquiriesController
  participant Enquiry as «entity»<br/>Enquiry
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: see enquiries on my IDPs
  UI->>B: GET /api/designer/enquiries (JWT)
  B->>C: list(Integer designerId, EnquiryStatus status, Pageable pageable)
  C->>Enquiry: findForDesigner()
  Enquiry->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Enquiry: rows
  Enquiry-->>C: result
  C-->>B: PageResponse<EnquirySummary>
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result